dna:[["Genetic technology","The Human Genome Project finished in 2003 after 13 years. CRISPR gene editing, developed in the 2010s, won Jennifer Doudna and Emmanuelle Charpentier the 2020 Nobel Prize in Chemistry."]],
bh:[["Sizes","Stellar black holes weigh a few to tens of solar masses, while supermassive ones at the centers of galaxies hold millions to billions. Sagittarius A* has about 4 million solar masses."]],
